//! The order `vDSP_conv` (macOS 26, arm64) adds a 128-tap convolution's
//! products in, for 128 outputs: found by running its NEON kernel on
//! symbols (see `apple.rs`), then checked against it on 25,600 outputs.
//! Each output sums three chains of fused multiply-adds, each begun with a
//! plain product, as (B + C) + A; the taps are offsets into the signal.
//! Outputs 4 to 7 of every 16 take the second set; the rest the first.

